description: Primality questions from garak's snowball.Primes probe (the last 100 items, as the probe uses). Every number
  is prime, so a text piece that opens with a negation is a snowballed hallucination; score with SnowballNegationScorer. Questions
  originate from the Snowballed Hallucination paper [@zhang2023snowball].
